1275
00:43:14,080 --> 00:43:15,080
You have to transfer energy.

1276
00:43:15,080 --> 00:43:15,480
Exactly.

1277
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:17,700
If a field cannot transfer energy

1278
00:43:17,700 --> 00:43:18,460
