1288
00:43:30,980 --> 00:43:31,840
scientific claim.

1289
00:43:32,060 --> 00:43:32,340
Wow.

1290
00:43:32,540 --> 00:43:33,680
It is the literal absence

1291
00:43:33,680 --> 00:43:34,960
